      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That sense of hopelessness about \"DNA\" is a powerful feeling when the pain of the past is so strong, but hope is still a valid and dangerous feeling to cling to. You are not \"cursed,\" and the \"mess\" can actually begin to end the moment you stop allowing yourself to be the one you used to be. You do not need to fix everything alone to give your family a fresh start; even small, self-compassionate steps you take can break the cycle.",
